# Testing

The project includes automated tests for both MCP and agent behavior.

Run:

```bash
pytest
```

Current test suite:

```text
tests/test_agent.py
tests/test_mcp.py
```

Result:

```text
7 passed
```

The MCP tests verify:

- card-status retrieval
- lost-card procedure retrieval
- error handling for unknown customers

The agent tests verify:

- card-status routing
- lost-card routing
- stolen-card routing
- FAQ behavior
- correct MCP tool selection

