# Models

The project uses environment variables for configurable chat-model selection.

Example:

```env
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5.6-luna
```

Speech components currently use:

```text
STT: gpt-4o-mini-transcribe
TTS: gpt-4o-mini-tts
```

