# Installation

## 1. Clone the repository

```bash
git clone <repository-url>
cd banking_ai_assistant
```

## 2. Create a virtual environment

Windows:

```powershell
python -m venv .venv
.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
```

## 3. Install dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```
